  "reasoning": "The defendants created a counterfeit official website and knowingly provided it to a co‑conspirator who used the site to deceive a victim into entering personal and banking information, resulting in the theft of over 5.6 million yuan. Their conduct constitutes participation in a scheme to defraud the public and is charged as fraud under the criminal code. No other listed offenses (e.g., forging state documents, computer system sabotage) are indicated in the facts as the primary charge.",
